  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0:\n- TiffanyClient.Signing: SignAsync(HttpRequestMessage) and SignatureHeadersAsync for requests you send yourself; null when it cannot sign\n- Log lines start with TiffanyLog.PREFIX ([tiffany])\n\nv2.1.0:\n- Video clips: VideoClipAsync (id, code, SEO) and VideoClipByMediaIDAsync; TrackMediaType.video_clip for media actions\n- PodcastBySeoAsync\n\nv2.0.1:\n- Storage logs through TiffanyLog\n\nv2.0.0 (breaking):\n- TiffanyConfig takes appID, appVersion and platform in its constructor; pass TiffanyPlatform.Detect() for the OS\n- Models: fields the spec may omit are nullable, fields it always sends are required\n- TiffanyLog: one logger with error, warn, info, debug and app hooks; network failures are warnings, no longer critical events\n\nv1.0.0:\n- TiffanyClient: auth, information, config, audience, commerce, media, events and track apis over one HttpClient; every call returns ApiResult<T>\n- Silent session refresh, shared between concurrent requests\n- Request signing (ECDSA P-256 install key, CNG on Windows), reactive or proactive\n- Server apps: optional App_Secret and the server-to-server routes\n- DPAPI storage on Windows, replaceable storage, transport and key store\n- Targets netstandard2.0, net48 and net9.0",
